      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "013.php 密码更新语句 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP 请求参数 `password_new`（013.php:8 处读取）提交恶意字符串，该值被直接拼接进 `$pass_new`，随后在 013.php:30 被拼入 UPDATE 语句：`UPDATE `users` SET password = '$pass_new' WHERE user = '...' LIMIT 1;`，最终在 013.php:31 由 `mysqli_query()` 执行。代码未对 `$pass_new` 做任何转义（无 mysqli_real_escape_string）、类型约束或参数化处理，单引号可直接闭合字符串字面量，从而改写 SET 子句或注入额外 SQL。注意：`user` 字段使用 `dvwaCurrentUser()` 而非直接外部输入，注入点集中在 `password_new` 参数值。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 29,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-89dab2f7ae60"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-89dab2f7ae60",
            "confidence": 0.4,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/013",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/captcha_bypass",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "DVWA CAPTCHA 绕过导致任意用户密码重置（硬编码验证码 + User-Agent 伪造）\n\n013.php 在处理密码修改时，CAPTCHA 校验逻辑存在硬编码后门：当 `g-recaptcha-response` 等于字符串 `hidd3n_valu3` 且 `HTTP_USER_AGENT` 等于 `reCAPTCHA` 时，条件恒真，完全绕过第三方 reCAPTCHA 校验。攻击者无需通过真实验证码即可进入密码修改分支，随后将 `password_new` 与 `password_conf` 设为相同值，即可把当前登录用户（dvwaCurrentUser()）的密码改为攻击者控制的值。结合 CSRF token 在密码修改逻辑之后才生成（第 53 行），攻击者可构造跨站请求诱导受害者提交，实现账户接管。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 17,
                  "endLine": 23
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "LLM-719de589f39a"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "LLM-719de589f39a",
            "confidence": 0.93,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "llm_inferred",
            "cwe": "CWE-804",
            "endpoint": "/013.php",
            "http_method": "POST",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "llm_finding"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/csrf",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "密码修改接口缺少 CSRF token 校验（token 在修改逻辑之后生成）\n\n013.php 在 POST Change 分支内直接执行密码修改，而 generateSessionToken() 在第 53 行、即密码修改逻辑之后才调用，说明密码修改请求本身不校验 Anti-CSRF token。攻击者可构造跨站表单，诱导已登录用户提交 password_new/password_conf，配合硬编码 CAPTCHA 后门完成静默密码重置。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 3,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
